00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.160
I received a letter from Miss McKenzie, so I'm writing back to her.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:29.880
After the final judgment, she went back to England to teach there again.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.870
didn't she? So, how is she doing? Great! She's really busy with her new school.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:44.910
No, Sakura. You and I may not be able to predict everything that will happen to you. You'll

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:49.950
have to be ready for anything that comes along. You mean it's not over? Oh, it's never

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:54.670
over. The world of magic is always changing. Your adventure won't end until you pass

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.350
the cards on to someone else. Someone else? So what do you think I should do then, Kiro?

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:06.120
Listen closely to your dreams and your instincts and never forget how far you've come.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:09.990
Uh-huh, of course. Don't worry, Kiro, I won't forget.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:19.160
So what's the kid been up to these days? Did he go back home to his family?

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:22.820
No, but he told me he is thinking about going back soon.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.860
