00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.780
You didn't finish your summer homework, did ya?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:36.530
Hmmmmmm...

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:39.600
I guess somehow, I'll be fine! I just know it!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:46.400
Oh, Kiro, you've got a-

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.600
Sakura, but, uh, the last time I helped ya, you got MAD at me!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.340
Time will be- I-

